sible yet nuanced distractors. One minor suggestion for improvement would be to further fine-tune the phrasing in one or two sentences of the passages to sharpen the contrast between the authors’ positions. This would help ensure even less ambiguity for students and more directly target the multi-step reasoning intended.", "difficulty_feedback": "This question is appropriately challenging for a Hard-difficulty label. It uses advanced vocabulary and demands the synthesis of complex ideas from both passages. The distractors are sophisticated and designed to trap superficial readings, which is in line with advanced SAT standards. To push the difficulty further, consider integrating an element that requires students to identify subtle implications or unstated assumptions in one of the passages."}

